  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd": "MOTD: %s",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.0": "Blink responsibly. Then file the report.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.1": "Cafeteria closed for re-containment. Again.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.2": "Do not feed the anomalies. This includes the friendly ones.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.3": "Lost: one coffee mug. If it talks back, return it to Storage B.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.4": "Hydrate. Containment is a marathon, not a sprint.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.5": "Elevator maintenance in progress. Please take the stairs. Count them.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.6": "Keycard readers updated. Swipe slowly and with confidence.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.7": "D-Class orientation moved to Hall 3. Do not ask why.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.8": "Remember: amnestics are not a snack.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.9": "Fire drill at 0900. Bring paperwork, not fire.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.10": "Report unusual events. Then report them again, to be sure.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.11": "Overtime approved for Site security. You know why.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.12": "Lab coats are not optional. Neither is common sense.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.13": "Please stop naming the anomalies. It makes the paperwork awkward.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.14": "Today's forecast: cloudy, with a slight chance of breach.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.15": "Smile. You are probably on camera.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.16": "If the lights flicker, do not wait to find out why.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.17": "Break room microwave is for food only. Food only.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.18": "Mandatory safety seminar this week: Doors and You.",
  "terminal.scp_unleashed.motd.19": "All clear. For now.",
